    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "GEMM and Conv2d are separate metrics; nothing is averaged across kernels. Conv2d FLOPs are 2 x N x Cout x H x W x Cin x 9 (Cout = 8) and its bytes count input, weights, and output. A failed script or missing value fails the run (no 1.0 default). The three rows carry the same values"
